title: 'v7 build round 4a: the learning loop closes (settlement + falsifiable liveness)'
summary: '§2-rev2 shipped: the orchestration learning loop is now actually closed. New #task-settlement module settles a parent when all siblings reach terminal (triggered inside updateTask), runs recordWorkLog→runPostflightLearning→autoPromoteJournalEntries, with idempotency, an orphan self-settle, and a reaper that crashes abandoned in-progress tasks. confidence_after is now a real agent value (literal fallback; belief-delta deferred to v7.x). A chainLive liveness probe + paradigm doctor check make ''self-improving'' falsifiable. Build clean; mcp 347→360, cli 387.'
